# Build-context filter for deploy/pwa/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of the root .dockerignore, which
# excludes deploy/).  Only admin/ sources and nginx.conf enter the
# build; local dependencies, build output and .env files never do.
*
!admin/
!deploy/pwa/nginx.conf
admin/node_modules
admin/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
